698	// TestCLISubmitValidUnicodeNodeRoundTrip checks the legal cases keep working
699	// end to end: a literal "�" is a valid character the user typed, an emoji
700	// written as a surrogate-pair escape is the same node as its literal form,
701	// and both are queryable by their original id.
